abstract: >-
  A Chinese-first fitness exercise dataset with 1,296 structured records,
  bilingual step-by-step instructions and AI-generated ordered movement images.
  Data and code are MIT-licensed; generated images are CC BY 4.0. Text derives
  from hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset (MIT). Not reviewed by medical or coaching
  professionals.
